{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0044_1001_p", "source_sha256": "15df4012f247c7afcbefb7037a2c41e519ebb18abf5a11679032800a0f9f1da3", "ja": "お疲れ千早！\n新しい衣装、気に入ってもらえたみたいだな。", "zh": "辛苦了，千早！\n看来你很喜欢新服装呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0044_1002_002chi", "source_sha256": "db6848cd8f5bf30c61260b58809dd837d66c722b7ac523b7428848ed866c2e24", "ja": "はい……不思議ですね。自分では、あまり衣装に\nこだわりがある方ではないと思っていたのですが。", "zh": "是的……真是不可思议。\n我本来以为自己不会对服装有什么想法的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0044_1003_p", "source_sha256": "48b979772e8794ffab45f659ed1f509628527c5fe1e4f8bfc6ed63e553e6df13", "ja": "俺もそう思ってたからこそ、嬉しいんだ。\nまさか鼻歌まで歌ってくれるなんてな！", "zh": "我原本也这么想，所以现在才更开心。\n没想到你喜欢到哼起歌来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0044_1004_002chi", "source_sha256": "bb1bc5986e5b6d3f32fe58c02ffd1b2d78cf2df332649e324bd0b4378bcb483a", "ja": "え……。", "zh": "咦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0044_1005_002chi", "source_sha256": "b4624d4c701ee220b7321841c5a61583b3fff67094dedbb0781775524b8f14a2", "ja": "っ、{$P$}？\nもしかして、ずっと後ろで聞いてたんですか？", "zh": "这、{$P$}？\n你该不会一直在后面听着吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0044_1006_p", "source_sha256": "c158268558c8f38b3dc9fab778616aaac2983e3bc87261595bd386656e67b66c", "ja": "え？　いや、ずっとは聞いてないけど、\n一瞬前くらいから聞いていた……かな？", "zh": "我吗？不是，不算一直啦，\n大概是从刚才开始听的……吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0044_1007_002chi", "source_sha256": "599a374fc53bf9ff089ded53b058e1609b68eebab1a4068aa1499d45caeb835c", "ja": "そうですか……すみません、{$P$}。\n浮わついた姿をお見せしてしまって。……くっ。", "zh": "这样啊……不好意思，{$P$}。\n让你看到我得意忘形的一面了……呜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0044_1008_p", "source_sha256": "872ef4ab400ad45981e80be84214e456f99c1b41cc33b9a94f7add455c51f065", "ja": "そんな、気にしなくても……。\n新しい衣装を着て喜ぶなんて、みんな普通のことだぞ？", "zh": "不用那么在意啦……\n穿上新服装当然会开心，大家都是这样喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0044_1009_002chi", "source_sha256": "ca3286587a5c3aca3dbf3277483986bb01514c830c9db5897f0355bf8d716273", "ja": "ですが、それなりに経験のある私がそんなことでは、\nあまりいいお手本にはならないかと。", "zh": "可是，我已经有过一些经验，\n这样似乎不是个好榜样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0044_1010_p", "source_sha256": "728263dafc0906cd9a27d71ddde65499b938bce7c484470d856422c6e5b81480", "ja": "（もっとお手本にならない先輩が、\nたくさんいるような気もするが……）", "zh": "（但我觉得有很多前辈\n更算不上好榜样……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0044_1011_p", "source_sha256": "b9816436a02b93b156fb70e6e250be50ccd4f496e8deb8f6277f5c9a20b6d619", "ja": "大丈夫だよ。千早はむしろ、浮かれてくれた方が\nいいお手本になるから。", "zh": "放心吧。以千早来说，我觉得你得意一点\n反而能成为大家的好榜样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0044_1012_002chi", "source_sha256": "27ab6fc9bed50741d57c1f9a2693bd7a5a7da18c38404ca0d3acfd84a406a3e5", "ja": "？　どういうことですか？", "zh": "咦？请问这是什么意思呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0044_1013_p", "source_sha256": "f8ada478027ec562b4d222d51ed342bc4cc981b7363a7292d0c08bbe34670c30", "ja": "つまり、普段から千早みたいに、\n真面目にレッスンに励んでいれば……。", "zh": "也就是说，这样大家就会知道，\n只要平常像千早一样认真参与训练课程……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0044_1014_p", "source_sha256": "6e7b817fc7d048b561ce001543d86c5910379e4465fcb6708fa59bb5842e8aff", "ja": "たまに浮かれるくらい楽しく過ごせる上、アイドルと\nしても千早並みにステップアップできる、となるだろ？", "zh": "就能过着偶尔可以得意一下的开心日子，\n还能发展到像千早这样的偶像地位，不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0044_1016_002chi", "source_sha256": "475c42083fad0ece5336e2cf514ee51778a6bfa24cbdd249261f4f5e39a101c8", "ja": "ふふっ。なりますか？", "zh": "呵呵，真的会那样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0044_1017_p", "source_sha256": "0a0a33864a9e14c64adf73d98f906741e10a3aeb416be5daad86962deb880d2c", "ja": "ならないかな……。\nわりとスジが通ってると思ったんだけど。", "zh": "不会吗……\n但我觉得还挺合理的啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0044_1018_002chi", "source_sha256": "0d7a4007992bc023e44813f61690bdcab1df53e1cbd68066c64ab403703fe0cc", "ja": "わりと……。わかりました。\nでは{$P$}のご指導に従って……。", "zh": "「挺合理的」……好吧。\n那我就照{$P$}的指示……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0044_1019_002chi", "source_sha256": "91e6376f695f8f76108b4fd3aa6a1cb8e4504d2e80e03415c71db02157324885", "ja": "たまには気を緩めて、浮かれることにします。\n……衣装、本当にありがとうございました。", "zh": "偶尔放松心情，得意一下吧。\n……真的很谢谢你准备这套服装。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0044_1020_p", "source_sha256": "03030c045fec9fc938e3daf8c8f6df7756635dd570891b21b50acc3d59be2d0b", "ja": "（そっと確かめるように、生地に手を添えている。\nこの衣装、千早の魅力を予想以上に引きだせるかもな）", "zh": "（千早的手轻轻摸着服装，感受它的质地。\n这套服装或许比想像中更能衬托出千早的魅力。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
